  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By Mail Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">By Mail projektet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Election Commission of BiH vill ha st&#xF6;d till postr&#xF6;stningen f&#xF6;r utlandsboende Bosnier, projektet &quot;By Mail&quot;. Election Commission of BiH &#xE4;r en statlig institution som rapporterar direkt till parlamentet. Projektet ber&#xE4;knas h&#xE5;lla p&#xE5; i &#xE5;tta m&#xE5;nader och avslutas i i princip p&#xE5; valdagen den 5 oktober 2002. Projektet kommer att p&#xE5;verka m&#xE4;n och kvinnor i lika utstr&#xE4;ckning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Election Commission of BiH is asking support for their by mail voting and registration of citizens living abroad. The project will start in March 2002 and end with the elections October 5, 2002. The project &quot;By Mail&quot; will have equal effect on men and women and will not have any significant effect on the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
